{'symbol': 'MOH', 'date': '2021-10-07 16:56:00', 'title': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE TO ACQUIRE CERTAIN ASSETS OF AGEWELL NEW YORK', 'text': "LONG BEACH, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOLINA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE: MOH) (“MOLINA”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE MEDICAID MANAGED LONG TERM CARE BUSINESS OF AGEWELL NEW YORK. THE PURCHASE PRICE FOR THE TRANSACTION IS APPROXIMATELY $110 MILLION, NET OF CERTAIN TAX BENEFITS AND MOLINA'S TARGET ALLOCATION OF REQUIRED REGULATORY CAPITAL. AGEWELL IS A SPECIALTY MANAGED CARE ORGANIZATION THAT PROVIDES LONG-TERM CARE SERVICES AT HOME OR IN THE COMMUNITY FOR THOS"}